## Resume Me Add Karne Ke Liye Short Version:

"I developed an AI-based Financial Management System using React.js, Node.js and Python FastAPI. The application uses a microservice architecture where Node.js handles business APIs and authentication, while a separate Python AI service handles machine learning predictions. I implemented Linear Regression for budget prediction and Random Forest Classification for investment recommendation. ML models were trained using Scikit-learn and deployed through FastAPI REST endpoints."

AI-Based Financial Management System

Developed a full-stack financial management application using React.js, Node.js, Express.js and MongoDB.
Built a Python FastAPI based AI microservice for financial prediction and recommendations.
Implemented Machine Learning models using Scikit-learn including Linear Regression for budget prediction and Random Forest Classifier for investment recommendation.
Applied data preprocessing techniques like One-Hot Encoding and model serialization using Joblib/Pickle.
Integrated AI prediction APIs with backend services to provide personalized financial insights.
